gs":[]},{"op":24,"name":"title_text","args":["统一前夕"]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["濡须口  曹操军主营"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n主公，这一天终于到来了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n孔明已经是我们的囊中物了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&贾诩\n不管他们施展什么计谋，\n只要一路猛攻就行了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[23,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n对方一定也是这么想的。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[13,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐晃\n主公，这是您的最后一战，\n请您说些话吧。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n刘备、袁绍等众多英雄，\n当年也是以这一战为目标。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n我们的心中充满他们的热情与抱负，\n既然如此也就无需多言了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n剩下的只是战斗，\n让我们来完成他们的心愿。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n是。\n大家的想法都是一样的。\n主公，朝统一天下的大道迈进吧。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。\n准备出战！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[20,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[13,0,1]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[19,0,3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[23,0,3]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":3586,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1280],[]]},"end":218,"end_off":4907},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[119,3,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n丞相，我有一计。\n&曹操\n奉先有什么计策？\n&吕布\n我听说当地有一些越族的后裔，\n很不满孙权的统治。\n我想去策反他们。\n&曹操\n有这种事情？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n千真万确！由丞相率主力部队从\n正面进攻，等敌军疲惫的时候，\n我再和貂蝉从后方支援丞相。\n&曹操\n这……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,16]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n不管我策反当地越族后裔成功与否，\n必将回来与丞相回合。\n&曹操\n好！就依奉先的意思办！\n下去准备吧……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&吕布\n得令！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[119,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,119,0,54,46,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,119,0,54,20,0]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[0,119,0,0,0,0,0]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[1456,1]},{"op":59,"name":"join","args":[119,255,0]},{"op":59,"name":"join","args":[17,255,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n既然如此，我們也準備出發吧！\n我們一定要結束這個亂世！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n拜託，請讓我出戰吧。\n&曹操\n啊？"]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[137,54,20,2,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,137,0,54,25,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[137,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n這一仗的意義重大，\n請丞相准許我一同參與。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[0,137,0,54,64,2]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[137,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n請讓我一起出征吧，\n我也希望參與最後一場戰役。"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n喔？\n&甄宓\n請成全小女子的請求吧。\n&曹操\n哈哈哈哈哈！\n&曹操\n就這樣吧，我就允許我的兒媳一起出戰了。\n希望你能有很好的表現啊！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[137,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&甄宓\n是！"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[137,0]},{"op":59,"name":"join","args":[137,0,0]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":4759,"cond":{"op":18,"name":"choice","args":["希望甄宓是舞孃造型\n希望甄宓是和服造型",0]},"end":217,"end_off":4905},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":4809,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[1]},"end":212,"end_off":4856},{"op":117,"name":"set_s_image","args":[137,256]},{"op":105,"name":"popup","args":["甄宓使用舞孃造型。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":4856,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[2]},"end":216,"end_off":4903},{"op":117,"name":"set_s_image","args":[137,22]},{"op":105,"name":"popup","args":["甄宓使用和服造型。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":4907,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[794],[]]},"end":223,"end_off":4962},{"op":111,"name":"lose_item","args":[116]},{"op":111,"name":"lose_item","args":[116]},{"op":105,"name":"popup","args":["本關不可使用獨角獸。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[1]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,15,0,0,0,0,0,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,15,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,15,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":6,"name":"battle_select_units","args":[1,15,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":5176,"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["戰前地圖預覽"]},"end":249,"end_off":5693},{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op"